  (text "MODULE DO AM DAT DIEN DUNG 'Capacitive Soil Moisture Sensor v1.2'\nJ4 PH2.0-3P (cung loai cong tren module): 1=GND 2=VCC 3=AOUT.\nNuoi tu VSENS 3.3V, chi bat khi do. Chon module dung TLC555 (NE555 khong chay o 3.3V).\nAOUT 0-3V (kho = cao) -> R12 1k -> IO1 (ADC1, ATTEN 12dB); C13 loc; D3 TVS chong ESD."
